---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Landest Infrastructure — Kennedy Ekanem"
  description="A dependable cloud and observability foundation for a property technology platform."
>
  <article class="project-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/#work">← Back to work</a>

    <header class="project-header">
      <p class="project-meta">DevOps · AWS · Observability</p>
      <h1>Landest Infrastructure</h1>
      <p class="project-intro">
        A dependable cloud foundation for a growing property technology platform.
      </p>
    </header>

    <figure class="project-image">
      <img src="/images/landestcropped.png" alt="Full Landest platform website" />
      <figcaption>The Landest property technology platform.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="project-copy">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Landest needed an infrastructure foundation that could support its core services,
        external integrations, and continued product growth without making operations fragile.
      </p>
      <p>
        I provisioned and deployed the API, gateway, and Zenith Bank proxy services on AWS,
        creating a clear route from external requests to internal services.
      </p>

      <h2>Operations and visibility</h2>
      <p>
        I configured a Docker-based Mailcow server and introduced OpenTelemetry across
        operations, bringing traces, metrics, and logs into one observability backend.
      </p>

      <dl class="details">
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>DevOps engineer</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Built for</dt><dd>Xanotech Solutions</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Year</dt><dd>2024</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>Amazon Web Services</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Services</dt><dd>API, gateway, bank proxy, and email</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Observability</dt><dd>OpenTelemetry traces, metrics, and logs</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <nav class="project-nav" aria-label="Project navigation">
      <a href="/#work">All projects</a>
      <a href="/projects/dragnet-erp">Next: Dragnet ERP →</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project-page{width:min(100% - 40px,680px);margin:0 auto;padding:64px 0 100px}.project-header{margin-top:72px;padding-bottom:28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.project-meta{margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.project-header h1{margin:0;font:clamp(34px,5vw,46px)/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.035em}.project-intro{max-width:620px;margin:24px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.project-image{width:min(860px,calc(100vw - 40px));margin:38px 0 0 50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}.project-image img{width:100%;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--soft)}.project-image figcaption{margin-top:9px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.project-copy{margin-top:58px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}.project-copy h2{margin:48px 0 10px;font:26px/1.3 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em}.project-copy h2:first-child{margin-top:0}.project-copy p{margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted)}.details{margin:50px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.details div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.details dt{color:var(--muted);font:10px Mono;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.details dd{margin:0;font-size:13px}.project-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:68px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}.project-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:600px){.project-page{padding-top:38px}.project-header{margin-top:48px}.project-header h1{font-size:32px}.project-intro{font-size:15px}.project-image img{padding:8px}.project-copy{margin-top:44px;font-size:16px}.details div{grid-template-columns:100px 1fr}}
</style>
<style>
  figure.project-image{width:100%!important;max-width:100%;margin:38px 0 0!important;padding:24px;transform:none!important;aspect-ratio:auto;overflow:visible;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}
  figure.project-image img{width:100%;height:auto!important;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:4px;object-fit:contain!important;background:transparent}
  figure.project-image figcaption{margin:12px 0 -12px}
  @media(max-width:600px){figure.project-image{padding:12px}figure.project-image figcaption{margin-bottom:-4px}}
</style>
